{"ID":"20240118151304-mruaa30","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151304-mruaa30","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151304-mruaa30\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151304-znkoe5x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122101011-q36skca\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122101011-q36skca\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:150,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:150\u0026#125;","title":"085王不留行","type":"doc","updated":"20240129165406"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151304-znkoe5x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151304-znkoe5x","updated":"20240122100921"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦平，主金创止血，逐痛出剌，除风痹内寒，久服轻身耐老。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100929-0834iip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100929-0834iip"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，为一年生草本植物，因其性走而不守，虽有王命，不能留行，故名之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100931-mfxmg64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100931-mfxmg64"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦性平，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100934-slgbaan","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100934-slgbaan"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】王不留行为行血要药，走血分通血脉，行月经，下乳汁，催生定痛，治金疮。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100936-7odgyqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100936-7odgyqk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】主金疮，止血逐痛，出刺。除风痹，内塞，止心烦，鼻衄，痈疽恶疮瘘乳，妇人难产。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100937-5v57r7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100937-5v57r7m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治风毒，通血脉。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100939-1dl3o9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100939-1dl3o9j"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】下乳汁。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100940-459nule","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100940-459nule"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】游风风疹，妇人经血不匀，发背。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100942-ijz5kdi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100942-ijz5kdi"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100943-rrv7roo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100943-rrv7roo"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】走而不守，血症慎用，孕妇忌之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100950-zgd8mvn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100950-zgd8mvn"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"民间方治妇人乳少，因气郁者：王不留行，穿山甲，炒龙骨，瞿麦穗，麦门冬等分为末，每服一钱，热酒调之，后食猪蹄汤。此名涌泉汤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122100945-jjl9jkj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100945-jjl9jkj"}},{"ID":"20240122100945-iclrqog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100945-iclrqog"}},{"ID":"20240122100945-qjh7qcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100945-qjh7qcm","updated":"20240129165202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第85位药，王不留行。经方里面有一个方叫王不留行散，王不留行是其中一味主味的药，还有其他的药跟着。那王不留行的意思就是，过去那部队作战，国王的命令你都要听哦。那你不听就砍头啦，这个王不留行是，它连国王的命令都不听，它管他的，就走掉啦，就是力量很强，就是你吃下去没有任何东西能够阻挡它，它是活血化瘀的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122100957-cjrgt6v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122100957-cjrgt6v","updated":"20240129165225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如说，老师我有个刺，肉刺刺在里面，外面的根断掉了，找不到，在里面找都找不到，刀子又挖不进去，怎么办，王不留行，下去的时候把它推出来，活血化瘀可以到这种程度，…它意思是这个药连国王的命令都不听，你一吃它就只管治，你说停，它都不停，行了不要活血化瘀那么强，不行，它说它都给你通通清掉了，所以说名字叫王不留行，形容它的活血的力量很强。"}]},{"ID":"20240122101004-d0p6efc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101004-d0p6efc","updated":"20240129165300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本经的原文呢，它是金创止血，能够逐痛出刺，这个非常好用，主治呢行血的要药，走血分，通血脉，行月经，下乳汁。所以说我们用在乳癌，当然很好用，因为它本身是行血的药嘛，乳癌本身就有很多淤血很多脓血化在里面，你可以用这个王不留行，那女人的子宫瘤、卵巢肿瘤当然可以用啊，可以催生定痛，可以止痛，任何的痛，如果不通则痛，你有淤血淤到，气堵到，淤血淤到，它就会痛，那你王不留行下去，活血化瘀的，行血的力量很强啊，吃了淤血就没有了，没有淤血的话痛就去掉了嘛。"}]},{"ID":"20240122101011-q36skca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122101011-q36skca","updated":"20240129165406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以看【别录】，这个王不留行呢，止血逐痛，还主痈疽恶疮，这个漏乳，这个乳房的问题，能够治风毒通血脉，下乳汁，月经不调。那后边的民间方呢，我们用得很多，像这过去一些民间方有炒麦芽，能够化乳汁的，那像涌泉汤，奶水太少的，我们也有，像猪脚，猪脚那个胶质很多，吃下去奶水会很多，配合一些王不留行啊、穿山甲这些滋补的药，诸位可以参考。"}]}]}